                    see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg96">p. 96</ref>. The
                    following statement appears at the head of the report: “This paper was not
                    approved but was returned to the Joint Planning Committee for reconsideration
                    and re-submission for further consideration.”</p>
            </note>
